Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:13:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stop tracking the API tokens; load config through one guarded
 loader

config.json carried two live Obsidian Local REST API bearer tokens and was
committed, even though .gitignore has a 'never commit' section. Untrack it,
ship config.example.json with placeholders, and route all five entrypoints
through load-config.js, which also accepts VAULT_BRAIN_TOKEN,
VAULT_BRAIN_UPSTREAM_TOKEN and VAULT_BRAIN_VAULT_PATH so a real token never
has to sit on disk. A fresh clone now fails with an instruction instead of
ENOENT.

The tokens remain in this repo's history and should be rotated in Obsidian.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018e7RTNjjvqCLb4X1QyVZTp
