NOTE: this patch leaves out one part of the commit it came from, the removal
of config.json, because that diff quotes both live tokens as removed lines and
reproducing it here would re-publish exactly what the fix exists to remove.
Untrack the file by hand:

    git rm --cached config.json

Then rotate both tokens in Obsidian (Settings -> Local REST API). They remain
in vault-brain's history, so untracking alone does not retire them.
